icials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', '<p>A new <strong>10,600-bed advanced hospital facility</strong> was officially opened to the public in <strong>Kutch</strong> today, offering free emergency care and subsidized treatment.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>robotic surgery suites and AI diagnostic systems</strong>, the hospital aims to provide <strong>world-class medical care to over 32,250 families</strong> in the region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588880331179-bc9b93a8cb5e?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '6e329fea-cd2d-4295-a98e-64bddfe20da6', '6f23d06f-50b3-4d6b-9834-42d7133b08a8', 'Kutch, Gujarat', 5, 70, 1, 0, 0, 0, 'State-of-the-Art Multi-Specialty Hospital Inaugurated in Kutch | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on healthcare and medical breakthroughs in Kutch. Read complete report inside.', 'Kutch, Gujarat news, Vadodara, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 19:21:53', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('0a95d045-426c-49ad-94e6-5c117e8f9630', 'market-boom-business-investments-in-gujarat-reach-record-high-1786108917674-95', 6, '#6 - Market Boom: Business Investments in Gujarat Reach Record High', '#6 - માર્કેટ બૂમ: Gujarat માં વ્યાપારી રોકાણ રેકોર્ડ સપાટીએ પહોંચ્યું', '#6 - मार्केट बूम: Gujarat में व्यावसायिक निवेश रिकॉर्ड स्तर पर पहुंचा', 'Latest updates on business, finance and market trends in Gujarat. Read complete report inside.', 'Gujarat માં Business, Finance and Market Trends અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Gujarat में Business, Finance and Market Trends से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>Foreign and domestic investments in <strong>Gujarat</strong> surged to an all-time high of <strong>₹14,500 crore</strong> during the current quarter.</p><p>The surge is attributed to <strong>favorable industrial policies, streamlined single-window clearances, and robust logistics networks</strong>.</p><p>Financial analysts project that <strong>continued economic expansion will create over 43,950 job opportunities</strong> across manufacturing, services, and trade sectors in Gujarat.</p>', '<p>Foreign and domestic investments in <strong>Gujarat</strong> surged to an all-time high of <strong>₹14,500 crore</strong> during the current quarter.</p><p>The surge is attributed to <strong>favorable industrial policies, streamlined single-window clearances, and robust logistics networks</strong>.</p><p>Financial analysts project that <strong>continued economic expansion will create over 43,950 job opportunities</strong> across manufacturing, services, and trade sectors in Gujarat.</p>', '<p>Foreign and domestic investments in <strong>Gujarat</strong> surged to an all-time high of <strong>₹14,500 crore</strong> during the current quarter.</p><p>The surge is attributed to <strong>favorable industrial policies, streamlined single-window clearances, and robust logistics networks</strong>.</p><p>Financial analysts project that <strong>continued economic expansion will create over 43,950 job opportunities</strong> across manufacturing, services, and trade sectors in Gujarat.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, 'aabdf17b-1604-4701-b21f-38ad111c027f', '6a24df1e-8b62-40d8-8dfb-ba8c12f60983', 'Gujarat, Gujarat', 5, 59, 0, 0, 1, 3, 'Market Boom: Business Investments in Gujarat Reach Record High | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on business, finance and market trends in Gujarat. Read complete report inside.', 'Gujarat, Gujarat news, Web Stories, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-30 15:21:57', '2026-08-18 06:07:36');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('0c7d4808-2229-4284-b18b-933fa9f63e92', 'warning-heavy-rain-alert-in-gujarat-for-next-three-days-48', 148, '#148 - Warning! Heavy rain alert in Gujarat for next three days - Full Ground Coverage', '#148 - સાવધાન! ગુજરાતમાં આગામી ત્રણ દિવસ ધોધમાર વરસાદની આગાહી', '#148 - सावधान! गुजरात में अगले तीन दिनों तक भारी बारिश की चेतावनी', 'A Gujarat Post special report explains how the development could affect residents, businesses and public administration.', 'ગુજરાત પોસ્ટની ખાસ રિપોર્ટ પ્રમાણે આ નિર્ણયથી સ્થાનિક લોકો, વેપાર અને વહીવટી વ્યવસ્થામાં સીધી અસર પડશે.', 'गुजरात पोस्ट की विशेष रिपोर्ट के अनुसार इस फैसले से स्थानीय लोगों, कारोबार और प्रशासन पर सीधा असर पड़ेगा.', 'Officials said detailed planning began soon after the latest decision. Dedicated teams are working to ensure timely public updates and smooth coordination between departments.', 'સ્થાનિક અધિકારીઓએ જણાવ્યું કે તાજેતરના નિર્ણય બાદ વિસ્તૃત આયોજન શરૂ કરી દેવામાં આવ્યું છે. લોકો સુધી જરૂરી માહિતી ઝડપથી પહોંચે તે માટે અલગ ટીમો કાર્યરત છે.', 'स्थानीय अधिकारियों ने बताया कि ताजा फैसले के बाद विस्तृत योजना पर काम शुरू कर दिया गया है. लोगों तक जरूरी जानकारी तेजी से पहुंचाने के लिए अलग टीमें सक्रिय हैं.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524995997946-a1c2e315a42f?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '142f3099-7bcb-4e0d-9d9a-d469066dce12', '9162cf30-4fba-40d8-a384-3583cdff56cf', NULL, 5, 73, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-07 12:23:21', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
