ng> within the next 12 months.</p><p>Local authorities emphasized that <strong>clean energy guarantees a healthier environment for future generations</strong> while driving down electricity tariffs for industries and households.</p>', '<p>A breakthrough solar and wind hybrid power project in <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> has reached its target capacity of <strong>13,000 Megawatts</strong> this week.</p><p>With this achievement, <strong>Gandhinagar becomes one of India\'s leading green energy hubs</strong>. Experts note that <strong>carbon emissions will drop by over 45%</strong> within the next 12 months.</p><p>Local authorities emphasized that <strong>clean energy guarantees a healthier environment for future generations</strong> while driving down electricity tariffs for industries and households.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '160fa9ec-b312-4b87-9341-1508f63b8298', '05402fdd-3719-4fe7-abbc-9e80725cd389', 'Gandhinagar, Gujarat', 4, 56, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Green Energy Initiative Set to Power 100% of Gandhinagar Public Grid | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on renewable energy and environment in Gandhinagar. Read complete report inside.', 'Gandhinagar, Gujarat news, Ahmedabad, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-31 11:21:55', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
