ng> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹32,700 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Bhavnagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>10,750 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹32,700 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609137144813-7d9921338f24?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '76e09d20-adf1-4d6c-8e4a-ef3ed2dacdc3', '702b6b81-2ab8-45e3-b2fe-50d3ec0c2d53', 'Bhavnagar, Gujarat', 6, 93, 0, 1, 0, 1, 'Bhavnagar Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Bhavnagar. Read complete report inside.', 'Bhavnagar, Gujarat news, Trending, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 17:21:53', '2026-08-17 10:00:36');
