 region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', '<p>A new <strong>12,400-bed advanced hospital facility</strong> was officially opened to the public in <strong>Ahmedabad</strong> today, offering free emergency care and subsidized treatment.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>robotic surgery suites and AI diagnostic systems</strong>, the hospital aims to provide <strong>world-class medical care to over 37,650 families</strong> in the region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '6e329fea-cd2d-4295-a98e-64bddfe20da6', 'f6650f9f-c367-4712-8ad1-18f599f12a53', 'Ahmedabad, Gujarat', 5, 89, 1, 0, 0, 0, 'State-of-the-Art Multi-Specialty Hospital Inaugurated in Ahmedabad | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on healthcare and medical breakthroughs in Ahmedabad. Read complete report inside.', 'Ahmedabad, Gujarat news, Gold - Silver, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-31 19:21:55', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('69efad82-2e61-43df-964a-d49bf7dd1244', 'major-smart-city-infrastructure-development-unveiled-in-rajkot-1786108907192-30', 71, '#71 - Major Smart City Infrastructure Development Unveiled in Rajkot', '#71 - Rajkot માં મુખ્ય સ્માર્ટ સિટી ઈન્ફ્રાસ્ટ્રક્ચર વિકાસનું અનાવરણ', '#71 - Rajkot में प्रमुख स्मार्ट सिटी इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर विकास का अनावरण', 'Latest updates on smart infrastructure and city development in Rajkot. Read complete report inside.', 'Rajkot માં Smart Infrastructure and City Development અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Rajkot में Smart Infrastructure and City Development से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>The state government has announced a massive <strong>₹4,750 crore development fund</strong> aimed at upgrading transit, smart water networks, and green parks across <strong>Rajkot</strong>.</p><p>Officials confirmed that <strong>over 14,700 direct jobs</strong> will be created during the execution phase. Speaking at the ceremony, project leads highlighted that <strong>modern urban living relies on intelligent automation and sustainable design</strong>.</p><p>Citizens of Rajkot have welcomed the move, noting that <strong>improved connectivity and public safety features</strong> will transform the urban landscape over the next two years.</p>', '<p>The state government has announced a massive <strong>₹4,750 crore development fund</strong> aimed at upgrading transit, smart water networks, and green parks across <strong>Rajkot</strong>.</p><p>Officials confirmed that <strong>over 14,700 direct jobs</strong> will be created during the execution phase. Speaking at the ceremony, project leads highlighted that <strong>modern urban living relies on intelligent automation and sustainable design</strong>.</p><p>Citizens of Rajkot have welcomed the move, noting that <strong>improved connectivity and public safety features</strong> will transform the urban landscape over the next two years.</p>', '<p>The state government has announced a massive <strong>₹4,750 crore development fund</strong> aimed at upgrading transit, smart water networks, and green parks across <strong>Rajkot</strong>.</p><p>Officials confirmed that <strong>over 14,700 direct jobs</strong> will be created during the execution phase. Speaking at the ceremony, project leads highlighted that <strong>modern urban living relies on intelligent automation and sustainable design</strong>.</p><p>Citizens of Rajkot have welcomed the move, noting that <strong>improved connectivity and public safety features</strong> will transform the urban landscape over the next two years.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507838153414-b4b713384a76?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '142f3099-7bcb-4e0d-9d9a-d469066dce12', '05acdc57-4700-4770-978b-c85f37e0f687', 'Rajkot, Gujarat', 6, 93, 1, 0, 0, 1, 'Major Smart City Infrastructure Development Unveiled in Rajkot | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on smart infrastructure and city development in Rajkot. Read complete report inside.', 'Rajkot, Gujarat news, Entertainment, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-05 01:21:47', '2026-08-17 10:00:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('69fc3d0c-a739-47bc-b7fc-c4c814bfe602', 'new-ai-tech-hub-opens-in-vadodara-to-foster-startup-ecosystem-1786108908620-38', 63, '#63 - New AI & Tech Hub Opens in Vadodara to Foster Startup Ecosystem', '#63 - Vadodara માં સ્ટાર્ટઅપ ઇકોસિસ્ટમને વેગ આપવા નવું AI અને ટેક હબ ખુલ્યું', '#63 - Vadodara में स्टार्टअप इकोसिस्टम को बढ़ावा देने के लिए नया AI और टेक हब खुला', 'Latest updates on tech & artificial intelligence revolution in Vadodara. Read complete report inside.', 'Vadodara માં Tech & Artificial Intelligence Revolution અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Vadodara में Tech & Artificial Intelligence Revolution से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹5,950 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 18,300 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹5,950 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 18,300 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹5,950 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 18,300 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589829085413-56de8ae18c73?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '56a17220-190a-4e17-b56e-7c06101f37f8', '66d1efc9-15ca-49af-b951-cff8c138d92b', 'Vadodara, Gujarat', 6, 94, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'New AI & Tech Hub Opens in Vadodara to Foster Startup Ecosystem | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on tech & artificial intelligence revolution in Vadodara. Read complete report inside.', 'Vadodara, Gujarat news, Weather, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04 09:21:48', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('6a77b90b-8e0d-4ae0-b56c-72bda33a6d25', 'tourists-flock-to-girnar-ropeway-huge-increase-in-numbers-51', 151, '#151 - Tourists flock to Girnar Ropeway: Huge increase in numbers - Full Ground Coverage', '#151 - ગિરનાર રોપ-વે પર ઉમટ્યા પ્રવાસીઓ! સંખ્યામાં જોરદાર વધારો', '#151 - गिरनार रोपवे पर उमड़े पर्यटक: संख्या में भारी बढ़ोतरी', 'A Gujarat Post special report explains how the development could affect residents, businesses and public administration.', 'ગુજરાત પોસ્ટની ખાસ રિપોર્ટ પ્રમાણે આ નિર્ણયથી સ્થાનિક લોકો, વેપાર અને વહીવટી વ્યવસ્થામાં સીધી અસર પડશે.', 'गुजरात पोस्ट की विशेष रिपोर्ट के अनुसार इस फैसले से स्थानीय लोगों, कारोबार और प्रशासन पर सीधा असर पड़ेगा.', 'Officials said detailed planning began soon after the latest decision. Dedicated teams are working to ensure timely public updates and smooth coordination between departments.', 'સ્થાનિક અધિકારીઓએ જણાવ્યું કે તાજેતરના નિર્ણય બાદ વિસ્તૃત આયોજન શરૂ કરી દેવામાં આવ્યું છે. લોકો સુધી જરૂરી માહિતી ઝડપથી પહોંચે તે માટે અલગ ટીમો કાર્યરત છે.', 'स्थानीय अधिकारियों ने बताया कि ताजा फैसले के बाद विस्तृत योजना पर काम शुरू कर दिया गया है. लोगों तक जरूरी जानकारी तेजी से पहुंचाने के लिए अलग टीमें सक्रिय हैं.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540910419892-4a36d2c3266c?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '160fa9ec-b312-4b87-9341-1508f63b8298', '9162cf30-4fba-40d8-a384-3583cdff56cf', NULL, 3, 70, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-07 12:23:22', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
