ent officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', '<p>A new <strong>8,800-bed advanced hospital facility</strong> was officially opened to the public in <strong>Rajkot</strong> today, offering free emergency care and subsidized treatment.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>robotic surgery suites and AI diagnostic systems</strong>, the hospital aims to provide <strong>world-class medical care to over 26,850 families</strong> in the region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508007557891-42fbdb51d47d?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '6e329fea-cd2d-4295-a98e-64bddfe20da6', '05402fdd-3719-4fe7-abbc-9e80725cd389', 'Rajkot, Gujarat', 3, 85, 1, 0, 0, 0, 'State-of-the-Art Multi-Specialty Hospital Inaugurated in Rajkot | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on healthcare and medical breakthroughs in Rajkot. Read complete report inside.', 'Rajkot, Gujarat news, Ahmedabad, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-02 19:21:51', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
