ss.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹21,900 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Surat</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>7,150 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹21,900 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537511446984-935f663eb1f4?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '76e09d20-adf1-4d6c-8e4a-ef3ed2dacdc3', 'a16e896a-139e-48c1-bd75-cb15309a4622', 'Surat, Gujarat', 5, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Surat Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Surat. Read complete report inside.', 'Surat, Gujarat news, Technology, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-03 17:21:49', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
