tups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹11,350 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 34,500 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512453979798-5ea266f8880c?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '56a17220-190a-4e17-b56e-7c06101f37f8', 'a16e896a-139e-48c1-bd75-cb15309a4622', 'Vadodara, Gujarat', 6, 54, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'New AI & Tech Hub Opens in Vadodara to Foster Startup Ecosystem | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on tech & artificial intelligence revolution in Vadodara. Read complete report inside.', 'Vadodara, Gujarat news, Technology, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 09:21:53', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
