ong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹13,150 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Gujarat</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 39,900 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '56a17220-190a-4e17-b56e-7c06101f37f8', '05acdc57-4700-4770-978b-c85f37e0f687', 'Gujarat, Gujarat', 5, 82, 0, 0, 0, 1, 'New AI & Tech Hub Opens in Gujarat to Foster Startup Ecosystem | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on tech & artificial intelligence revolution in Gujarat. Read complete report inside.', 'Gujarat, Gujarat news, Entertainment, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-31 09:21:55', '2026-08-17 10:00:55');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('c513562e-54ad-4c4b-bc0e-638c258ee15e', 'gandhinagar-athletes-win-big-at-national-championship-event-1786108914690-76', 25, '#25 - Gandhinagar Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event', '#25 - રાષ્ટ્રીય ચેમ્પિયનશિપ ઇવેન્ટમાં Gandhinagar ના ખેલાડીઓની ભવ્ય જીત', '#25 - राष्ट्रीय चैंपियनशिप प्रतियोगिता में Gandhinagar के एथलीटों ने बड़ी जीत हासिल की', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Gandhinagar. Read complete report inside.', 'Gandhinagar માં Sports Excellence and Youth Empowerment અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Gandhinagar में Sports Excellence and Youth Empowerment से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>11,650 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹35,400 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>11,650 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹35,400 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>11,650 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹35,400 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469474968028-56623f02e42e?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '76e09d20-adf1-4d6c-8e4a-ef3ed2dacdc3', 'b6423e89-dda8-489c-bd82-78e0fe179d65', 'Gandhinagar, Gujarat', 5, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gandhinagar Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Gandhinagar. Read complete report inside.', 'Gandhinagar, Gujarat news, Fact Check, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 05:21:54', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
