ng> will be created during the execution phase. Speaking at the ceremony, project leads highlighted that <strong>modern urban living relies on intelligent automation and sustainable design</strong>.</p><p>Citizens of Ahmedabad have welcomed the move, noting that <strong>improved connectivity and public safety features</strong> will transform the urban landscape over the next two years.</p>', '<p>The state government has announced a massive <strong>₹2,950 crore development fund</strong> aimed at upgrading transit, smart water networks, and green parks across <strong>Ahmedabad</strong>.</p><p>Officials confirmed that <strong>over 9,300 direct jobs</strong> will be created during the execution phase. Speaking at the ceremony, project leads highlighted that <strong>modern urban living relies on intelligent automation and sustainable design</strong>.</p><p>Citizens of Ahmedabad have welcomed the move, noting that <strong>improved connectivity and public safety features</strong> will transform the urban landscape over the next two years.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526256262350-7da7584cf5eb?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '142f3099-7bcb-4e0d-9d9a-d469066dce12', 'a16e896a-139e-48c1-bd75-cb15309a4622', 'Ahmedabad, Gujarat', 4, 67, 1, 0, 0, 1, 'Major Smart City Infrastructure Development Unveiled in Ahmedabad | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on smart infrastructure and city development in Ahmedabad. Read complete report inside.', 'Ahmedabad, Gujarat news, Technology, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 01:21:45', '2026-08-19 01:11:10');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('cb6e1fb1-b920-472d-b73b-ea480c4d27e9', 'dahod-railway-electric-locomotive-factory-tribal-skill-academy', 265, 'Dahod Railway Electric Locomotive Factory and Tribal Skill Academy', 'દાહોદ રેલવે ઇલેક્ટ્રિક લોકોમોટિવ મેન્યુફેક્ચરિંગ કારખાનું અને કૌશલ્ય વિકાસ કેન્દ્ર', 'दाहोद रेलवे इलेक्ट्रिक लोकोमोटिव कारखाना और कौशल विकास केंद्र', 'Dahod Locomotive Plant produces high-horsepower freight engines generating 10000 tribal jobs.', 'દાહોદ ખાતે રૂ. ૨૦,૦૦૦ કરોડના ખર્ચે બનેલા રેલવે લોકોમોટિવ પ્લાન્ટમાંથી પ્રથમ હાઇ-સ્પીડ એન્જિન તૈયાર થયું.', 'दाहोद में 20,000 करोड़ रुपये के रेलवे लोकोमोटिव संयंत्र से पहला हाई-स्पीड इंजन तैयार हुआ।', '<p>આદિવાસી બહુલ દાહોદ જિલ્લામાં ભારતીય રેલવેનો અત્યાધુનિક 9000 હોર્સપાવર ઇલેક્ટ્રિક લોકોમોટિવ પ્લાન્ટ કાર્યરત થયો છે. સ્થાનિક યુવાનોને વર્લ્ડ ક્લાસ ઓટોમેશન તાલીમ આપીને રેલ એન્જિનિયરિંગ ક્ષેત્રે જોડવામાં આવી રહ્યા છે.</p>', '<p>આદિવાસી બહુલ દાહોદ જિલ્લામાં ભારતીય રેલવેનો અત્યાધુનિક ઇલેક્ટ્રિક લોકોમોટિવ પ્લાન્ટ કાર્યરત થયો છે.</p>', '<p>आदिवासी बहुल दाहोद जिले में भारतीय रेलवे का अत्याधुनिक इलेक्ट्रिक लोकोमोटिव प्लांट शुरू हुआ।</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1474487548417-781cb71495f3?w=1200&q=90', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '142f3099-7bcb-4e0d-9d9a-d469066dce12', '968c7b79-e486-4a36-8720-99f33c015339', 'Dahod', 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 06:12:34', '2026-08-19 04:51:07');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('cbc75cec-968f-4510-9aea-39a05140bcb0', 'major-change-in-darshan-timings-at-dwarka-temple-important-update-for-devotees-46', 146, '#146 - Major change in Darshan timings at Dwarka Temple, important update for devotees - Full Ground Coverage', '#146 - દ્વારકા મંદિરના દર્શન સમયમાં મોટો ફેરફાર, શ્રદ્ધાળુઓ જરૂર વાંચે', '#146 - द्वारका मंदिर के दर्शन समय में बड़ा बदलाव, श्रद्धालु जरूर पढ़ें', 'A Gujarat Post special report explains how the development could affect residents, businesses and public administration.', 'ગુજરાત પોસ્ટની ખાસ રિપોર્ટ પ્રમાણે આ નિર્ણયથી સ્થાનિક લોકો, વેપાર અને વહીવટી વ્યવસ્થામાં સીધી અસર પડશે.', 'गुजरात पोस्ट की विशेष रिपोर्ट के अनुसार इस फैसले से स्थानीय लोगों, कारोबार और प्रशासन पर सीधा असर पड़ेगा.', 'Officials said detailed planning began soon after the latest decision. Dedicated teams are working to ensure timely public updates and smooth coordination between departments.', 'સ્થાનિક અધિકારીઓએ જણાવ્યું કે તાજેતરના નિર્ણય બાદ વિસ્તૃત આયોજન શરૂ કરી દેવામાં આવ્યું છે. લોકો સુધી જરૂરી માહિતી ઝડપથી પહોંચે તે માટે અલગ ટીમો કાર્યરત છે.', 'स्थानीय अधिकारियों ने बताया कि ताजा फैसले के बाद विस्तृत योजना पर काम शुरू कर दिया गया है. लोगों तक जरूरी जानकारी तेजी से पहुंचाने के लिए अलग टीमें सक्रिय हैं.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '160fa9ec-b312-4b87-9341-1508f63b8298', '9162cf30-4fba-40d8-a384-3583cdff56cf', NULL, 3, 75, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-07 12:23:21', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('cbe4bc98-9b67-4100-9937-747de587743d', 'gandhinagar-athletes-win-big-at-national-championship-event-1786108908849-40', 61, '#61 - Gandhinagar Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event', '#61 - રાષ્ટ્રીય ચેમ્પિયનશિપ ઇવેન્ટમાં Gandhinagar ના ખેલાડીઓની ભવ્ય જીત', '#61 - राष्ट्रीय चैंपियनशिप प्रतियोगिता में Gandhinagar के एथलीटों ने बड़ी जीत हासिल की', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Gandhinagar. Read complete report inside.', 'Gandhinagar માં Sports Excellence and Youth Empowerment અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Gandhinagar में Sports Excellence and Youth Empowerment से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>6,250 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹19,200 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>6,250 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹19,200 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Gandhinagar</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>6,250 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹19,200 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1444703686981-a3abbc4d4fe3?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '76e09d20-adf1-4d6c-8e4a-ef3ed2dacdc3', '6df0d11b-0d54-4980-b581-1e4185a04584', 'Gandhinagar, Gujarat', 4, 78, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Gandhinagar Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Gandhinagar. Read complete report inside.', 'Gandhinagar, Gujarat news, Business, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04 05:21:48', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('cd2d1e5b-eb44-4e49-880e-47002bc71793', 'navsari-floriculture-exotic-fruit-plantation-farming-revolution', 261, 'Navsari Floriculture and Exotic Fruit Plantation revolutionizes farming', 'નવસારીના બાગાયતી ખેડૂતોનો કમાલ: ડ્રેગન ફ્રૂટ અને ઓર્ગેનિક ખેતીથી કરોડોની કમાણી', 'नवसारी के बागवानी किसानों का कमाल: ड्रैगन फ्रूट और जैविक खेती से बड़ी कमाई', 'Navsari South Gujarat farmers adopt high-density drip irrigation for dragon fruit and avocados.', 'નવસારી કૃષિ યુનિવર્સિટીના માર્ગદર્શન હેઠળ દક્ષિણ ગુજરાતના ખેડૂતોએ વિદેશી ફળોનું સફળ ઉત્પાદન કર્યું.', 'नवसारी कृषि विश्वविद्यालय के मार्गदर्शन में दक्षिण गुजरात के किसानों ने विदेशी फलों का सफल उत्पादन किया।', '<p>દક્ષિણ ગુજરાતના નવસારી જિલ્લામાં હાઇ-ટેક બાગાયતી ખેતીએ નવો ચીલો ચાતર્યો છે. ઇઝરાયેલી ટપક સિંચાઈ પદ્ધતિ અને શેડનેટ ટેકનોલોજીનો ઉપયોગ કરીને નવસારીના ખેડૂતો ઓર્ગેનિક ડ્રેગન ફ્રૂટ, એવોકાડો અને ગુલાબની ખેતીથી લાખો રૂપિયાની કમાણી કરી રહ્યા છે.</p>', '<p>દક્ષિણ ગુજરાતના નવસારી જિલ્લામાં હાઇ-ટેક બાગાયતી ખેતીએ નવો ચીલો ચાતર્યો છે.</p>', '<p>दक्षिण गुजरात के नवसारी जिले में हाई-टेक बागवानी खेती ने एक नया इतिहास रचा है।</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595855759920-86582396756a?w=1200&q=90', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '142f3099-7bcb-4e0d-9d9a-d469066dce12', '968c7b79-e486-4a36-8720-99f33c015339', 'Navsari', 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 06:12:34', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('cd7c8827-20d8-4be2-b518-18c0e58cb256', 'new-ai-tech-hub-opens-in-vadodara-to-foster-startup-ecosystem-1786108911193-56', 45, '#45 - New AI & Tech Hub Opens in Vadodara to Foster Startup Ecosystem', '#45 - Vadodara માં સ્ટાર્ટઅપ ઇકોસિસ્ટમને વેગ આપવા નવું AI અને ટેક હબ ખુલ્યું', '#45 - Vadodara में स्टार्टअप इकोसिस्टम को बढ़ावा देने के लिए नया AI और टेक हब खुला', 'Latest updates on tech & artificial intelligence revolution in Vadodara. Read complete report inside.', 'Vadodara માં Tech & Artificial Intelligence Revolution અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Vadodara में Tech & Artificial Intelligence Revolution से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹8,650 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 26,400 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹8,650 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 26,400 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', '<p>In a major boost for the digital economy, a new <strong>₹8,650 crore AI Innovation Center</strong> was inaugurated in <strong>Vadodara</strong> today.</p><p>The hub features <strong>supercomputing facilities, cloud credits, and mentorship</strong> from global tech leaders. It is projected to incubate <strong>more than 26,400 tech startups</strong> by the end of 2027.</p><p>Industry experts stated that <strong>Gujarat\'s commitment to artificial intelligence and deep-tech innovation</strong> will position the state as a premier global technology destination.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532375810709-75b1da00537c?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '56a17220-190a-4e17-b56e-7c06101f37f8', '04867180-ae79-4e17-a570-b6d4a944d6e3', 'Vadodara, Gujarat', 4, 69, 0, 1, 0, 1, 'New AI & Tech Hub Opens in Vadodara to Foster Startup Ecosystem | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on tech & artificial intelligence revolution in Vadodara. Read complete report inside.', 'Vadodara, Gujarat news, Photo Gallery, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-02 21:21:51', '2026-08-17 10:00:52');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('cde4d30f-d3d5-44d4-8655-7a3c2b46c157', 'tourists-flock-to-girnar-ropeway-huge-increase-in-numbers-87', 187, '#187 - Tourists flock to Girnar Ropeway: Huge increase in numbers - Full Ground Coverage', '#187 - ગિરનાર રોપ-વે પર ઉમટ્યા પ્રવાસીઓ! સંખ્યામાં જોરદાર વધારો', '#187 - गिरनार रोपवे पर उमड़े पर्यटक: संख्या में भारी बढ़ोतरी', 'A Gujarat Post special report explains how the development could affect residents, businesses and public administration.', 'ગુજરાત પોસ્ટની ખાસ રિપોર્ટ પ્રમાણે આ નિર્ણયથી સ્થાનિક લોકો, વેપાર અને વહીવટી વ્યવસ્થામાં સીધી અસર પડશે.', 'गुजरात पोस्ट की विशेष रिपोर्ट के अनुसार इस फैसले से स्थानीय लोगों, कारोबार और प्रशासन पर सीधा असर पड़ेगा.', 'Officials said detailed planning began soon after the latest decision. Dedicated teams are working to ensure timely public updates and smooth coordination between departments.', 'સ્થાનિક અધિકારીઓએ જણાવ્યું કે તાજેતરના નિર્ણય બાદ વિસ્તૃત આયોજન શરૂ કરી દેવામાં આવ્યું છે. લોકો સુધી જરૂરી માહિતી ઝડપથી પહોંચે તે માટે અલગ ટીમો કાર્યરત છે.', 'स्थानीय अधिकारियों ने बताया कि ताजा फैसले के बाद विस्तृत योजना पर काम शुरू कर दिया गया है. लोगों तक जरूरी जानकारी तेजी से पहुंचाने के लिए अलग टीमें सक्रिय हैं.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541872703-74c5e44368f9?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '6e329fea-cd2d-4295-a98e-64bddfe20da6', '9162cf30-4fba-40d8-a384-3583cdff56cf', NULL, 4, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-07 12:23:36', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
