cess.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹38,100 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', '<p>Athletes from <strong>Surat</strong> delivered an outstanding performance at the National Games, bagging a total of <strong>12,550 Gold medals</strong> across multiple sports disciplines.</p><p>The team\'s captain dedicated the victory to their coaches and supporters, stating that <strong>rigorous discipline and state-backed sports academies</strong> played a vital role in their success.</p><p>Sports officials announced a <strong>₹38,100 lakh incentive award</strong> for all winning athletes to support their training for upcoming international tournaments.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511556532299-8f662fc26c06?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '76e09d20-adf1-4d6c-8e4a-ef3ed2dacdc3', 'f7afc75b-6ce9-4e78-942e-569780c4ea25', 'Surat, Gujarat', 6, 91, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Surat Athletes Win Big at National Championship Event | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on sports excellence and youth empowerment in Surat. Read complete report inside.', 'Surat, Gujarat news, World, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-31 17:21:55', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `slug`, `articleNumber`, `title`, `titleGu`, `titleHi`, `excerpt`, `excerptGu`, `excerptHi`, `content`, `contentGu`, `contentHi`, `featuredImage`, `status`, `scheduledAt`, `authorId`, `categoryId`, `location`, `readingTime`, `priority`, `isTrending`, `isBreaking`, `isFeatured`, `views`, `seoTitle`, `seoDescription`, `seoKeywords`, `canonicalUrl`, `metaRobots`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES ('d64d3e04-7cec-438f-a023-ba28302dfb5d', 'state-of-the-art-multi-specialty-hospital-inaugurated-in-rajkot-1786108905675-21', 80, '#80 - State-of-the-Art Multi-Specialty Hospital Inaugurated in Rajkot', '#80 - Rajkot માં અત્યાધુનિક મલ્ટી-સ્પેશિયાલિટી હોસ્પિટલનું ઉદ્ઘાટન', '#80 - Rajkot में अत्याधुनिक मल्टी-स्पेशलिटी अस्पताल का उद्घाटन', 'Latest updates on healthcare and medical breakthroughs in Rajkot. Read complete report inside.', 'Rajkot માં Healthcare and Medical Breakthroughs અંગેના વાયરલ અને તાજા સમાચાર.', 'Rajkot में Healthcare and Medical Breakthroughs से जुड़ी सभी नई अपडेट्स और विस्तृत रिपोर्ट।', '<p>A new <strong>3,400-bed advanced hospital facility</strong> was officially opened to the public in <strong>Rajkot</strong> today, offering free emergency care and subsidized treatment.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>robotic surgery suites and AI diagnostic systems</strong>, the hospital aims to provide <strong>world-class medical care to over 10,650 families</strong> in the region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', '<p>A new <strong>3,400-bed advanced hospital facility</strong> was officially opened to the public in <strong>Rajkot</strong> today, offering free emergency care and subsidized treatment.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>robotic surgery suites and AI diagnostic systems</strong>, the hospital aims to provide <strong>world-class medical care to over 10,650 families</strong> in the region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', '<p>A new <strong>3,400-bed advanced hospital facility</strong> was officially opened to the public in <strong>Rajkot</strong> today, offering free emergency care and subsidized treatment.</p><p>Equipped with <strong>robotic surgery suites and AI diagnostic systems</strong>, the hospital aims to provide <strong>world-class medical care to over 10,650 families</strong> in the region.</p><p>Health department officials emphasized that <strong>preventative healthcare and accessible medicine remain top priorities</strong> for the state administration.</p>', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587370560942-ad2a04eabb6d?w=800&q=80', 'PUBLISHED', NULL, '6e329fea-cd2d-4295-a98e-64bddfe20da6', 'b7016886-3e6a-4452-a198-afcfa9e5663d', 'Rajkot, Gujarat', 3, 85, 1, 1, 0, 0, 'State-of-the-Art Multi-Specialty Hospital Inaugurated in Rajkot | Gujarat Post', 'Latest updates on healthcare and medical breakthroughs in Rajkot. Read complete report inside.', 'Rajkot, Gujarat news, Gandhinagar, latest updates', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-05 19:21:45', '2026-08-14 11:11:58');
